        "world:creature:17993",
        "world:creature:18587"
      ],
      "text": "You are in the Botanica, a botanical lab inside Tempest Keep in Netherstorm. Commander Sarannis, High Botanist Freywinn, Thorngrin the Tender and Warp Splinter are its guardians. Freywinn guards delicate specimens and summons plants to his aid, while Bloodwarder Protectors and Frayers fill its halls. Warp Splinter defends a sanctuary here, though its threats break into doubt.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 3847
      }
    }
  ],
